OL,3,ATougher punishments for criminals who
OL,4,Arefuse to attend sentencing backed by
OL,5,Avictim's family
OL,6,
OL,7,FTougher punishments for offenders who
OL,8,Frefuse to attend their sentencings will
OL,9,F"rebalance the power" in the justice
OL,10,Fsystem, the aunt of murder victim Zara
OL,11,FAleena has said.
OL,13,FFrom next year, prisoners could be
OL,14,Fblocked from prison visits and confined
OL,15,Fto their cells for weeks on end if they
OL,16,Fdo not follow orders to go to court.
OL,18,FThis builds on an existing law that
OL,19,Forders criminals to attend sentencing
OL,20,For face being fined or jailed for
OL,21,Fanother two years.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
