OL,3,ATougher punishments for criminals who
OL,4,Arefuse to attend sentencing backed by
OL,5,Avictim's family
OL,6,
OL,7,F"A year or two added to a life sentence
OL,8,Fwouldn't make any difference to an
OL,9,Foffender. But taking away these
OL,10,Fprivileges would," Farah Naz said.
